<title>UK: Cattles sells Rosebys shares at 275p/shr.</title>
<headline>Cattles sells Rosebys shares at 275p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British financial services firm Cattles Plc said on Monday it sold its entire 22.8 percent stake in Rosebys Plc for 275p per share.</p>
</text>
